The smart thermostat makes it easier to control your household temperature. You can schedule your thermostat working hours so it will work based on your plan. With a smart thermostat, you will be able to remotely control the temperature anytime through your mobile phone.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- Support up to 4 pipes Heating & Cooling Fan coil system
- Vertical Alignment panel
- Temperature and humidity display
- System mode: Heat-Off-Cool-Ventilation
- Fan mode: AUTO-Low-Medium-High
- Sleep/Eco mode
- Motion detection
- ON/OFF Scheduling
- Heating & cooling indicator
- Remote control
